# Tamiyo's Safekeeping: "Target permanent you control gains hexproof and indestructible until end of turn. You gain 2 life."
# Bot1 can't target Bot2's Ornithopter with it ("you control"), and casts it on its own in response to Bot2's Wrath of God: the
# Wrath destroys Bot2's Ornithopter, and Bot1's, indestructible, survives it (CR 702.12b), and Bot1 gains 2. Hexproof keeps Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt off it that turn (CR 702.11b), though the Bolt can still be cast at Bot1 (the positive control). Both keywords
# end with the turn (CR 514.2): on Bot1's turn the Ornithopter flies and has nothing else.

